    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95850.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "And we're taking in depth on a number of storylines out of DC. Budget bill work is going to stretch into the weekend as we approach the possibility of a partial government shutdown. Local representative Kat Kamak live in Washington. Our preparations needing to be underway that we're going to be heading into a government shutdown at the end of the month.",
