  {
    "episode_id": 95850,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95850.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Several of my congressional colleagues and I, we've been comparing lists and we know that there are several thousands folks that got left behind and this ranges from military contractors, people doing NGO work, missionaries, students. There's a ton of folks that got left behind. And so while we don't have an exact number, part of what we passed out of the House last night includes a requirement from the Secretary of Defense to work in conjunction with the Department of State to get that number finally. Because they have not provided a number. They said they don't know. They know exactly. And we can combine lists. And that's how we did it. So we're going to continue to push forward to get our folks home. And I've got to tell you the fact that they're still. several thousand that got left behind that is concerning that this administration has been telling a mission complete and successful flag all over the place.",
